nd-atlas/texas/leon-county"],["ARC or PLC in Leon County","/arc-plc/texas/leon-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids May to June and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 184% of normal in May to June 2025 and 47% in November to December 2025. Grid 13636 had its driest year in 1963 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
